        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEAHzDu7rLel9SJ9N2Gf59hK6ziYYFAmotjYYbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEBn+fYSus4mGLuQP/AoCeR8OCtuZem5M0Mlb\niRYFTKkbTPitMBg+tqmNxieqzqwSC2LCtDQENd3eRcLQ95k2pteARtfgzKX7yPIs\n+onbvCxrtsV50f+QPtgKaGkEZ3pVrB9kXK0uUjE6CVC/3j+em0M7ZhjmUcsxkg2+\nhr4goXrNueiuLFN4rXPn6QxMdax8V3BH9NASTRpFkDoK+ZpdmWgvP6eQDFuBL0zE\nOdfAM7ReOJwq4FwHYYIHZQhBrk+YSCRdZNsjpwk2yJuTzEOjzZBlMvouIPla9xQC\nMmgSUqgeAd8ZZdSx2VJ7F16HfGv0WNx9E8L86ivtmKd29D6awiOsqBCqxPGf/mQf\nIJHan3+JVreP1t8GwqNVjw+Vx4qqYcsJzNMRwdkcpQfBLBW5amMu0TSK7zgNdWB3\nnBueUn/M+tIwvHDnOIgCMF4h2cPCVM1VUmrbZtVJA6lY2DIP1t7nFdlhOuYmZI87\nPRz/hdue2VM1xKx9LRDufda9l9un2aV94uG2V3sdlteP6uOJk53FEmIm0Niuu39/\nJ0r8fKcI5KTaiSjvH+R5LadKgmK5Jc8ywnnCaTwrwsXTYPLuiGn7dxb+gVNsEXxj\n7FbZR2EhGc+uPuVvOdRzOk6tYJW52EVSxnAOh9lDzHxZ+9euJpWNVTPAqvoFi6k0\nr30PcMKfj4iIdGa9o8uTmUFb\n=jv7O\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----",
        "payload": "tree 3885b721a11448b806a981df37f9aec50d09ec5e\nparent f1f4d687b12caac079d81ffc5ee50a16d1fabc1a\nauthor Bernat Gabor <gaborjbernat@gmail.com> 1781369441 -0700\ncommitter Bernat Gabor <gaborjbernat@gmail.com> 1781370246 -0700\n\nDrop Python 3.8 support\n\nCPython 3.8 reached end of life on 2024-10-07, more than 18 months ago,\nwhich meets the project policy for dropping a version. virtualenv now\nrequires Python 3.9 or later to run and to create environments.\n\nvirtualenv bundled the embedded wheel seed package only for Python 3.8,\nso this removes it: the wheel files, the 3.8 bundle entry, and the wheel\nhandling in the upgrade tooling. The --wheel and --no-wheel options stay\nas no-ops, but the deprecation warning is louder and now states that\nvirtualenv will remove them in a release after 2026-12.\n\nThis also drops the macOS pyvenv launcher patch, which only applied to\nCPython 3.8.0-3.8.2, and updates packaging metadata, the CI matrix, tox\nenvironments, tests, and docs.\n",
        "verified_at": "2026-06-13T17:05:20Z"
      }
